Variable                           N        Sum       Mean
------------------------------------------------------------
Length (True values)             425    429.530      1.011
Round (Rounded values)           425    432.800      1.018
RoundEven (Round-to-even values)        425    430.800      1.014

PROC MEANS: Proportion rounded up (ndec=3)
Variable                                          N       Mean
-----------------------------------------------------------------
RoundUp                                         425      0.560
